sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant DataProvider
    participant KgdbAdapter
    participant Kgdb
    participant GraphStore
    participant Canvas
    Operator->>DataProvider: open editor
    DataProvider->>Kgdb: fetch GraphSnapshot
    Kgdb->>KgdbAdapter: GraphSnapshot
    KgdbAdapter->>DataProvider: kgdb_to_ui_graph -> GraphData
    DataProvider->>GraphStore: loadGraph(nodes, edges)
    Operator->>Canvas: edit node/edge/attribute
    Canvas->>GraphStore: updateNode/addEdge/removeElements
    Operator->>DataProvider: save (Ctrl+S)
    DataProvider->>Kgdb: persist mutations (write-back)
    Kgdb->>DataProvider: ok